      usage: ["review", "challenge"],
      vignette: "A 4-month-old was born at term and was well at first. Over the last month he has stopped kicking and can barely lift his arms. He is bright, smiles, and follows faces. He lies with his legs in a frog-leg posture. Reflexes are absent. His tongue shows fine, constant twitching, and his belly rises while his chest wall sinks with each breath. Sensation appears normal.",
